## Environment

New env vars must be registered in `packages/config/src/validate-env.js` before use. Load config via `loadConfig()` from `@__QUARK_SCOPE__/config`.

---

## Deployment

Railway: two services (`web` + `worker`). Migrations auto-run on deploy via `preDeploy` in `.railway/railway.ts`. Env vars managed in Railway dashboard - never committed.
